{
  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The new Discover Weekly algorithm is actually getting better. It found three obscure jazz tracks I've been looking for years. The seamless integration with my car's Bluetooth is also flawless now."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "Good music library, but the price hike was annoying. I'm still here because my friends are, but I'd switch if Apple Music offered a better student discount."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Best app on the market. The offline downloads work perfectly even on my old phone, and the podcast section is surprisingly good. No ads, great quality."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "I love the family plan. Sharing costs with my parents and siblings makes it unbeatable. The UI is clean and the recommendations for my kids are age-appropriate."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Solid service. The shuffle feature is decent, though I wish it didn't repeat songs so often in long playlists. Audio quality is fine for my earbuds."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "It's reliable. I don't have many complaints, but the app crashes occasionally when I switch between music and podcasts. Otherwise, it's a 8/10 experience."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "Decent, but the lack of lossless audio on the standard tier is a letdown. I'm considering upgrading to Premium Plus, but the price is steep."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "The lyrics feature is a nice touch. I use it for karaoke nights. The app is stable, though I wish the search function was faster for live events."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "Good overall. The customer support was helpful when my account got locked. The music catalog is vast, but I miss the old interface layout."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "Terrible. My subscription charged me twice this month and support ignored my emails for a week. The app keeps buffering in my car. I'm cancelling."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "Excellent. The new AI DJ feature is surprisingly entertaining. It mixes tracks well and keeps the energy up during my workouts. Highly recommend."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "Perfect. No ads, high-quality audio, and the playlist curation is top-notch. I've been a subscriber for 5 years and never looked back."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "Love it. The integration with my smart home devices is seamless. I can start music in the kitchen and follow it to the bedroom. Great ecosystem."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "Very good. The podcast exclusives are a big plus for me. The app is fast and the battery drain is minimal. Just wish the price was lower."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "It's okay. The recommendations are hit or miss. Sometimes they're great, other times they're completely off. The UI is intuitive, though."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "Great service. The offline mode is essential for my commutes. The audio quality is crisp, and the app rarely glitches. I'm very satisfied."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "Good, but the family plan management is clunky. Removing a member is a hassle. The music itself is great, but the admin side needs work."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Average. I like the music, but the ads on the free tier are too intrusive. I'm on Premium, but the price increase makes me hesitate to renew."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "Outstanding. The new interface is much cleaner. The search is faster, and the playlist sharing is easier. I'm impressed with the updates."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "Worst experience. My account was suspended without warning. No email, no notification. I lost all my playlists. This is unacceptable."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "Very good. The student discount is a lifesaver. The app is stable, and the music catalog is extensive. I recommend it to all my friends."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "Horrible. The app crashes every time I try to download music. I've reinstalled it three times. No support, no fix. I'm done."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "Good. The audio quality is excellent on my headphones. The app is smooth, and the recommendations are generally accurate. I'm happy with it."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "It's fine. I use it mostly for podcasts. The music side is okay, but I don't use it as much. The app is reliable, which is what matters."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "Meh. The price is too high for what you get. The ads are annoying, and the app is slow on my older phone. I'm looking for alternatives."
    }
  ]
}
